WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.635 --> 00:00:03.307
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What time do you get up in the morning?

2
00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:06.402
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> I usually get up at about seven.

3
00:00:06.816 --> 00:00:12.966
That way I have time to do some exercise or go for a run, or even play squash before breakfast.

4
00:00:13.158 --> 00:00:15.275
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What do you have for breakfast?

5
00:00:15.336 --> 00:00:19.127
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> Cereal and milk, and toast with honey or jam.

6
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:22.141
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you have classes every day?

7
00:00:22.424 --> 00:00:25.953
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> I have lectures in the morning every day except Friday.

8
00:00:26.316 --> 00:00:31.770
Lectures are classes for everybody who studies politics. Some of those are online.

9
00:00:31.962 --> 00:00:36.943
Then I also have tutorials on Thursday afternoon and Friday morning.

10
00:00:37.245 --> 00:00:40.552
Tutorials are small face-to-face classes.

11
00:00:41.177 --> 00:00:47.741
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> And what do you do when you don’t have lectures or tutorials? Is that free time?

12
00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:51.552
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> No, I study! I have exams soon.

13
00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:54.960
I work in my room or in the university library.

14
00:00:55.273 --> 00:00:57.340
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Where do you have lunch?

15
00:00:57.672 --> 00:01:05.184
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> I usually have lunch at uni at about one o’clock, but sometimes I just have a sandwich in a café in town.

16
00:01:05.507 --> 00:01:08.904
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you go out in the evening during the week?

17
00:01:09.096 --> 00:01:11.596
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> Well, music is my main hobby.

18
00:01:11.889 --> 00:01:17.021
I’m in the university choir and I sing every evening from six to seven.

19
00:01:17.505 --> 00:01:20.943
I also play percussion in the university orchestra.

20
00:01:21.528 --> 00:01:28.152
After choir, I sometimes go to the pub with friends, or we watch a film, especially at weekends.

21
00:01:28.646 --> 00:01:31.167
But I often need to study in the evenings, too.

22
00:01:31.631 --> 00:01:33.667
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Where do you have dinner?

23
00:01:34.151 --> 00:01:38.850
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> Sometimes I go out with my friends, but usually I eat at uni.

24
00:01:39.354 --> 00:01:44.657
The food is quite good, actually. A lot of my friends cook, but I’m terrible at cooking.

25
00:01:45.907 --> 00:01:48.015
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What time do you go to bed?

26
00:01:48.247 --> 00:01:53.288
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> At about eleven. I’m usually so tired I go to sleep straight away.

27
00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:58.874
It’s my last year, so all I really do these days is study, eat, and sleep.

28
00:02:00.023 --> 00:02:02.725
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do your parents come and visit you?

29
00:02:02.967 --> 00:02:05.952
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> My mother comes about once or twice a term.

30
00:02:06.093 --> 00:02:10.408
But I prefer to go home and see her there because I’m terribly untidy,

31
00:02:10.469 --> 00:02:15.671
so when she comes to visit, I need to spend the whole day cleaning and tidying my room!